[00:52.26] This old man, he worked for thirty years with two strong hands
[01:01.98] In the factory light his lunch box held all his needs
[01:12.68] With coffee, sandwiches and dreams for me
[01:28.40] This old man, he taught me many times to understand
[01:38.18] That showing love is simply nothing you should have to hide
[01:48.58] "Don't keep your feelings locked inside", he said
[02:12.16] When I was young, I dreamed a young man's dreams
[02:18.88] I saw in your eyes the things I'd never seen
[02:25.90] But now I grow old but I don't really mind
[02:32.92] 'Cause can't you see with my family we'll share these timeless memories
